FROM golang:1.26.10-alpine@sha256:27f2d3b83cfc5803c8078f8e730af0f7c431bf067afaec8f60a36fb763187cba AS builder
ENV GOTOOLCHAIN=local

WORKDIR /app
COPY go.mod go.sum ./
RUN go mod download

COPY . .
RUN CGO_ENABLED=0 go build -o /webapp .

FROM alpine:3.23@sha256:85fe1e81d6758c208f3e1eed4338a1997e19d4be002d4dd32d3100c9a8c010a0
RUN apk add --no-cache ca-certificates \
    && addgroup -S webapp \
    && adduser -S -G webapp webapp
COPY --from=builder --chown=webapp:webapp /webapp /webapp

EXPOSE 9090
USER webapp
ENTRYPOINT ["/webapp"]
